// The icons a habit can show in the habit list. They are MingCute's regular
// icons (https://github.com/mingcute-design/mingcute-icons, Apache-2.0),
// copied from kryonlabs/mingcute's generated shapes. Each habit saves its
// icon's number, so an icon keeps its number and new icons go at the end.

HABIT_ICON_COUNT :: 37
// A habit that shows the first letter of its name, chosen in its editor or
// because no icon fits it; 0 means no icon has been chosen yet.
HABIT_ICON_LETTER :: -1
// The icons a habit linked to a practice shows until it has its own.
HABIT_ICON_LOTUS :: 1
HABIT_ICON_YOGA :: 3
HABIT_ICON_LUNGS :: 4
HABIT_ICON_YIN_YANG :: 37

